# Cloudflare Pages — proxy para a API (mesma origem, sem CORS)
# Substitua SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com pela URL do seu serviço (docs/deploy.md).
# Enquanto não substituir, /api e /c respondem 502.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

/api/*          https://SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com/api/:splat        200
/c/*            https://SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com/c/:splat          200
/static/*       https://SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com/static/:splat     200
/media/*        https://SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com/media/:splat      200
/docs           https://SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com/docs              200
/openapi.json   https://SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com/openapi.json      200
/health         https://SEU-SERVICO.onrender.com/health            200

# SPA fallback (precisa ser a última regra)
/*              /index.html                                                200
